# Normalise line endings. Without this, files written by different tools land in the
# repository with different endings and every later diff carries the whole file as
# changed. LF in the repository and LF on checkout, on every platform - mingw make,
# gcc and windres all read LF without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
*.res binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.dll binary
